msgctxt "64"
msgid "Oh, hello, Kiryu-san. Heading out for the day?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Yeah, I thought I'd go downtown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I just came back from there. Ryukyu Boulevard is swarming with tourists "
"right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"I was only trying to run some errands, but people kept stopping me to ask "
"about nearly everything under the sun... I wish Okinawa wasn't so popular."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "I know what you mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"If you're looking to pick up some ingredients for dinner, try the Kariyushi "
"Arcade or the Public Market."
msgstr ""

